From 29944a1d7a7e5518379df4b7ba31cfcf2fc78fb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:05:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Add mg4 and the RH850 G4 instructions

Add the option and the G4 directive for the RH850 G4 cores with CLIP,
byte and halfword LDL and STC and RESBANK, and the G4 system register
names in the assembler and the disassembler.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
